        "note_tweet": {
          "entities": {},
          "text": "Talked about this on stream the other day, but I still find it a bit odd that your player profile pushes your KD as such an important factor when Ubisoft themselves also hammer in the fact that Siege isn't all about kills.\n\nIt would make significantly more sense if it highlighted your average score per game or something along those lines. Kills then still contribute to this, but so does support plays, util clearing, reinforcing etc.\n\nI think giving players a visual KD stat forces more players to focus of fragging and improving that stat, then doing other things to contribute to the game\n\nthis isn't a \"you cant frag in Siege\" take, rather a \"fragging shouldn't be the only factor\" take"
        },
